(text "The XIAO and the C920 camera each have their own USB cable to the Jetson, through the turntable's hollow." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 180 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1641c140-73d6-5759-a325-6d07826f7c31"))
(text "No Wi-Fi/BT: the XIAO's antenna stays unplugged. Displays run from the XIAO's 3V3 (~150-250 mA total)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 183.81 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "12413754-e927-5d1f-b5a8-2a52ec398188"))
(text "One SPI bus (SCL, SDA, DC, RST shared); a CS per display. 26-28 AWG silicone wire soldered straight to the pads." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 187.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "34f6e876-eb99-534d-b245-1591bd02d8a9"))
(text "The eyes mount upside down: the firmware rotates their image 180 deg. D2 (GPIO3, strapping), D7, D9 free." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 191.43 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4d915631-788a-5c79-b034-2d7971d6d50c"))
(embedded_fonts no))
